      "properties": {
        "reported": true,
        "property_type": "magnetic",
        "summary": "Co(III) is diamagnetic. χMT at 300 K is 47.39 cm3 K mol−1 (expected 47.24 for four non-interacting Tb(III)). χMT decreases on cooling to 38.41 cm3 K mol−1 at 2 K, consistent with antiferromagnetic Ln–Ln coupling and/or Stark-level depopulation. Magnetization saturates at 19.5 μB (2 K, 5 T). Zero-dc-field ac susceptibility (2.5 Oe, 10–1000 Hz) shows no frequency-dependent signals.",
        "measurements": [
